menu "Night Sentinel build"

    config NS_DEBUG_HTTP
        bool "Web server (page, live view, /snap.jpg, /detect, /sd, actions)"
        default y
        help
            Development tool with no password. Turn off for a demo build.
            The other switches are with their components:
              Platform: inference    which model is built in, start at boot or not
              Platform: recorder     video recording
              Platform: web server   live stream
              Platform: camera and IR
              Night Sentinel app / network / alerts

endmenu
